        "npc": "Dooooom!"
      },
      {
        "player": "Where?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "All around us! I can feel it in the air, hear it on the wind, smell it... also in the air!"
      },
      {
        "player": "Is there anything we can do about this doom?"
